    {
      "style": "PFGreeting",
      "text": "Dear Hiring Team,"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "I prepared Avery Rivera’s evidence brief from the candidate-provided career narrative. The permission…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The supplied Northbank Learning brief names research planning, reusable guidance and beginner-friendly…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Source E01, supplied fictional evidence record, fixture-v1: Avery reports designing and moderating 12…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "If this is relevant, please reply to me to confirm the recipient and permitted material version before…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PFScope",
      "text": "PERM-Q016-v1 · Simulated only; no actual candidate permission or referral exists. Modeled grantor:…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PFScope",
      "text": "Modeled versions: D47-Q016-v1 and D40-Q016-v1. The D40 brief is not included in this standalone letter.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PFScope",
      "text": "Language: English. Recorded 1 October 2026 (fictional scenario); valid until 15 October 2026 (fictional…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PFScope",
      "text": "Reply to the brief preparer; request separate permission before releasing candidate contact details.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PFClosing",
      "text": "Kind regards,"
    },
    {
